WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Background music]
Project spotlight: TecnoSur Distribución. Segregated routes and serial capture.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Before: forklifts and pedestrians share the same crossing, 13 near-misses in a year.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
After: a dedicated walkway and a serial-capture gate. Near-misses drop from 13 to 4 a year.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Results: near-misses per year 13 to 4 (-69%). Dock turnaround 96 to 52 minutes (-46%). Error returns 3.1% to 1.3% (-58%).

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Nexora Intralogistics Solutions.
